{"page":153,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"2.7 • 소켓 프로그래임: 네트위크 0H를리게이,년 생성","words":[{"text":"2.7","x":782,"y":157,"width":39,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":853,"y":162,"width":11,"height":14},{"text":"소켓","x":895,"y":156,"width":50,"height":30},{"text":"프로그래임:","x":957,"y":155,"width":137,"height":31},{"text":"네트위크","x":1110,"y":157,"width":100,"height":29},{"text":"0H를리게이,년","x":1221,"y":157,"width":153,"height":30},{"text":"생성","x":1385,"y":156,"width":50,"height":31}]},{"text":"구한바 수 있다. 이것은 22절에시 설명하있고 RFC 2616에 정화하게 정의되어 있다.","words":[{"text":"구한바","x":192,"y":286,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":306,"y":286,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":356,"y":286,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"이것은","x":443,"y":286,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"22절에시","x":553,"y":285,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"설명하있고","x":714,"y":286,"width":158,"height":38},{"text":"RFC","x":887,"y":291,"width":68,"height":30},{"text":"2616에","x":971,"y":287,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"정화하게","x":1095,"y":287,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"정의되어","x":1240,"y":287,"width":126,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":1385,"y":287,"width":70,"height":37}]},{"text":"유사하게 서버 프로그램도 HTTP 서버 프로토콜을 구현할 수 있고- 이것도 RFC 2616","words":[{"text":"유사하게","x":192,"y":346,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"서버","x":341,"y":347,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램도","x":418,"y":347,"width":161,"height":37},{"text":"HTTP","x":594,"y":352,"width":92,"height":28},{"text":"서버","x":701,"y":347,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜을","x":778,"y":347,"width":160,"height":38},{"text":"구현할","x":952,"y":347,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1064,"y":347,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"있고-","x":1112,"y":348,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"이것도","x":1190,"y":348,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"RFC","x":1300,"y":352,"width":68,"height":30},{"text":"2616","x":1383,"y":352,"width":74,"height":30}]},{"text":"에 정의되어 있다. 한 개발자가 클라이언트 프로그램에 대한 고드를 만들고 다른 독자","words":[{"text":"에","x":193,"y":408,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"정의되어","x":241,"y":408,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"있다.","x":387,"y":408,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":473,"y":408,"width":32,"height":37},{"text":"개발자가","x":521,"y":407,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트","x":662,"y":408,"width":160,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램에","x":836,"y":407,"width":159,"height":38},{"text":"대한","x":1014,"y":408,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"고드를","x":1092,"y":409,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"만들고","x":1203,"y":408,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":1314,"y":409,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"독자","x":1391,"y":409,"width":66,"height":38}]},{"text":"적인 개발자가 서버 프로그램에 대한 코드를 작성하고, 그리고 이들 모두 RFC의 규지","words":[{"text":"적인","x":195,"y":469,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"개발자가","x":275,"y":469,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"서버","x":419,"y":468,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램에","x":495,"y":469,"width":159,"height":37},{"text":"대한","x":672,"y":469,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"코드를","x":748,"y":470,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"작성하고,","x":857,"y":469,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"그리고","x":1009,"y":469,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"이들","x":1121,"y":470,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"모두","x":1198,"y":471,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"RFC의","x":1276,"y":470,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"규지","x":1392,"y":470,"width":61,"height":37}]},{"text":"을 철저히 따른다면 두 프로그램은 제대로 상호작용할 것이다. 사실 오늘날 대부그분의","words":[{"text":"을","x":192,"y":530,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"철저히","x":243,"y":529,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"따른다면","x":356,"y":529,"width":127,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":500,"y":531,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"프로그램은","x":547,"y":530,"width":162,"height":36},{"text":"제대로","x":725,"y":529,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"상호작용할","x":834,"y":528,"width":162,"height":39},{"text":"것이다.","x":1014,"y":530,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"사실","x":1135,"y":530,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"오늘날","x":1214,"y":530,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"대부그분의","x":1328,"y":530,"width":125,"height":38}]},{"text":"네트워크 애플리게이션은 독립 개발자가 개발한 클라이언트와 서버 프로그램 간의 통","words":[{"text":"네트워크","x":194,"y":590,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"애플리게이션은","x":340,"y":590,"width":228,"height":37},{"text":"독립","x":581,"y":590,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"개발자가","x":661,"y":590,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"개발한","x":803,"y":589,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트와","x":912,"y":589,"width":198,"height":38},{"text":"서버","x":1124,"y":591,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램","x":1202,"y":591,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"간의","x":1347,"y":592,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"통","x":1425,"y":593,"width":32,"height":37}]},{"text":"신을 포함한다(아파치 웹 서버와 통신하는 구글 그름 브라우저 국은 비트토랜트 추적","words":[{"text":"신을","x":194,"y":651,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"포함한다(아파치","x":273,"y":650,"width":239,"height":39},{"text":"웹","x":531,"y":650,"width":28,"height":37},{"text":"서버와","x":577,"y":650,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"통신하는","x":686,"y":650,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"구글","x":829,"y":651,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"그름","x":909,"y":651,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"브라우저","x":988,"y":650,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"국은","x":1134,"y":651,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"비트토랜트","x":1216,"y":651,"width":161,"height":37},{"text":"추적","x":1391,"y":653,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"기와 통신하는 비트토렌트 클라이언트 등).","words":[{"text":"기와","x":195,"y":712,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"통신하는","x":270,"y":711,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"비트토렌트","x":416,"y":711,"width":161,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트","x":589,"y":711,"width":161,"height":37},{"text":"등).","x":762,"y":712,"width":51,"height":37}]},{"text":"다른 형태의 네트워크 애플리케이션은 개인의 독점적인 네트워크 에플리게이션이","words":[{"text":"다른","x":258,"y":772,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"형태의","x":337,"y":772,"width":93,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":448,"y":772,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"애플리케이션은","x":590,"y":771,"width":226,"height":38},{"text":"개인의","x":830,"y":771,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"독점적인","x":938,"y":771,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크","x":1086,"y":773,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"에플리게이션이","x":1229,"y":772,"width":225,"height":38}]},{"text":"다. 이 경우 클라이언트와 서버 프로그램은 RFC 또는 다른 곳에 공식적으로 출판되지","words":[{"text":"다.","x":194,"y":834,"width":37,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":249,"y":833,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"경우","x":295,"y":833,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트와","x":370,"y":833,"width":198,"height":37},{"text":"서버","x":580,"y":833,"width":60,"height":38},{"text":"프로그램은","x":656,"y":832,"width":162,"height":37},{"text":"RFC","x":831,"y":836,"width":68,"height":30},{"text":"또는","x":914,"y":834,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":993,"y":832,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"곳에","x":1071,"y":833,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"공식적으로","x":1150,"y":833,"width":165,"height":37},{"text":"출판되지","x":1328,"y":832,"width":126,"height":37}]},{"text":"않은 애플리케이션 계층 프로토콜을 채택한다. 개인 개발자(휴-은 개발팀)는 클라이언","words":[{"text":"않은","x":193,"y":896,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"애플리케이션","x":270,"y":894,"width":194,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":483,"y":894,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜을","x":562,"y":894,"width":161,"height":37},{"text":"채택한다.","x":739,"y":893,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"개인","x":894,"y":893,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"개발자(휴-은","x":975,"y":893,"width":178,"height":39},{"text":"개발팀)는","x":1170,"y":893,"width":143,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언","x":1328,"y":893,"width":129,"height":36}]},{"text":"트와 서버 프로그램 모두 생성하고, 이 개발자는 코드에 무엇을 사용하는가에 대한 완","words":[{"text":"트와","x":193,"y":955,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"서버","x":272,"y":954,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"프로그램","x":349,"y":955,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"모두","x":494,"y":957,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"생성하고,","x":573,"y":955,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":724,"y":954,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"개발자는","x":769,"y":953,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"코드에","x":912,"y":954,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"무엇을","x":1024,"y":954,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"사용하는가에","x":1137,"y":952,"width":196,"height":39},{"text":"대한","x":1350,"y":953,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"완","x":1426,"y":953,"width":34,"height":36}]},{"text":"전한 제어를 갖는다. 그러나 그 코드는 공개된 프로토콜로 구현되지 않기 때문에, 다른","words":[{"text":"전한","x":195,"y":1016,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"제어를","x":271,"y":1015,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"갖는다.","x":381,"y":1016,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"그러나","x":501,"y":1016,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":610,"y":1021,"width":31,"height":26},{"text":"코드는","x":654,"y":1017,"width":97,"height":35},{"text":"공개된","x":762,"y":1014,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"프로토콜로","x":872,"y":1017,"width":165,"height":35},{"text":"구현되지","x":1049,"y":1014,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"않기","x":1197,"y":1014,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"때문에,","x":1276,"y":1013,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":1395,"y":1013,"width":63,"height":37}]},{"text":"독립 개발자는 이 애플리케이션과 상호작용하는 코드를 개발할 수 없다.","words":[{"text":"독립","x":192,"y":1077,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"개발자는","x":271,"y":1076,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":413,"y":1076,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션과","x":457,"y":1077,"width":227,"height":37},{"text":"상호작용하는","x":695,"y":1076,"width":195,"height":38},{"text":"코드를","x":902,"y":1077,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"개발할","x":1014,"y":1076,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1126,"y":1075,"width":34,"height":37},{"text":"없다.","x":1173,"y":1074,"width":71,"height":38}]},{"text":"이 절에서 클라이언트-서버 애플리케이션을 개발하는 데 중요한 문제를 살펴보고","words":[{"text":"이","x":257,"y":1137,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"절에서","x":302,"y":1137,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트-서버","x":410,"y":1138,"width":250,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케이션을","x":676,"y":1136,"width":227,"height":39},{"text":"개발하는","x":916,"y":1137,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"데","x":1061,"y":1137,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"중요한","x":1105,"y":1136,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"문제를","x":1217,"y":1136,"width":99,"height":3